'''Hajime Saito''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that can be obtained by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Rurouni Kenshin Collaboration Event]]. He was added in [[Version 13.4 Update|Version 13.4]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 749
|rarity = UR
|name1 = Hajime Saito
|name2 = Hajime Saito CC
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Hajime Saito CC''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
Hajime Saito is largely unremarkable as a generalist with his low range and stats, but becomes incredibly dangerous within his niche. Despite having a mere 200 standing range, his Omni Strikes can reach up to 400 to catch many more walking directly into the line of fire, destroying any Shields he could hit to greatly weaken Aku threats reliant on them. His high speed and full backswing cooldown does compensate for his lack of range to some extent by easing timing and reducing his suicidal tendencies, even against those that would easily hit him, while his knockback count increases the amount of burst damage he could deal. Though likely to fall in battle soon, his low cooldown does facilitate rapid replacements if used properly to maximize his value.

{{Job|Classification = Rusher & Nuker}}

